@format 1
@id export.reorder-presets
@title Reorder export presets
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Move one custom export preset with stable panel capture and a cursor-aligned shared ghost.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@flow TB
@related export.add-preset

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Preset drag begins <input>
- Capture the stable preset panel while retaining the pressed row and row-relative grab offset @ export.PExportRowBuild(...)
> track

[track] Track drag <process>
- Measure movement in preset-panel coordinates and show the shared row ghost after the threshold @ export.PExportMoveHandle(...)
- Resolve the target index without changing the drag origin coordinate space @ export.PExportIndexResolve(...)
> move

[move] Apply live order <decision>
- Reject native-preset movement and no-op indices @ export.PExportLiveMove(...)
? "Move is not allowed" > release
? "A new custom index is valid" > synchronize

[synchronize] Synchronize order <process>
- Persist the order while suppressing a rebuild of the initiating panel during its active drag @ export.PExportPresetSync(...)
> release

[release] Finish drag <process>
- Restore opacity, clear the ghost, and release panel capture @ export.PExportUpHandle(...)
> result

[result] Preset moved <output>
= Custom preset order matches the visible list.
